    "description": '''
    [#FF1414]<Tier II Flame Tank>[]
    
    Artillery-based flame tank, armed with a repurposed turret of a Golem Tank. Fires incendiary artillery shells that cause area-wide fires.

    Has a decent range than its predecessor. Can fire from a distance and best used in groups to maximize fires occuring.

    Cannot attack air targets.
    ''',
